title: "Survey data cleaning: 2018 Carr Wildfire Evacuation Survey"
abstract: "A reproducible pipeline that repairs a public Qualtrics export of the 2018 Carr Wildfire evacuation survey, documents every recoding decision, and publishes a cleaned analysis table."
